      "message": "Optional: I found two ways to use `AOM_SCREEN_DETECTION_STANDARD` here without excessive reformatting by clang-format, as shown in the following patch:\n\n```\ndiff --git a/av1/av1_cx_iface.c b/av1/av1_cx_iface.c\nindex 18b54f9707..bdbec6957d 100644\n--- a/av1/av1_cx_iface.c\n+++ b/av1/av1_cx_iface.c\n@@ -368,7 +368,8 @@ static const struct av1_extracfg default_extra_cfg \u003d {\n   0,               // strict_level_conformance\n   -1,              // kf_max_pyr_height\n   0,               // sb_qp_sweep\n-  1,               // screen_detection_mode\n+  // screen_detection_mode\n+  AOM_SCREEN_DETECTION_STANDARD,\n };\n #else\n // Some settings are changed for realtime only build.\n@@ -523,7 +524,7 @@ static const struct av1_extracfg default_extra_cfg \u003d {\n   0,               // strict_level_conformance\n   -1,              // kf_max_pyr_height\n   0,               // sb_qp_sweep\n-  1,               // screen_detection_mode\n+  AOM_SCREEN_DETECTION_STANDARD,\n };\n #endif\n \n```\n\nThe first way is to move the comment before the initializer. The second way is to delete the comment, which is acceptable because the initializer is a symbolic constant.",
